#: ../../source/Network_APIs/TCP_Server_APIs.rst:836
#: 554e019e9bac4a1b9f9a602e656ce1be
msgid ""
"This mode is useful when you need an individual port for the server or  must"
" reserve a controlled range of ports for client-file transfers by manual "
"port allocation, such as in a testing environment or when multiple server "
"processes share the same host."
msgstr ""
